SUMMARY:Haunted Marietta
DESCRIPTION:HAUNTED MARIETTA IS MOVING!\nThe spirits are restless and they’ve found a new place to dwell. We’re relocating to a darker\, more sinister corner of town\, designed to chill you to the bone. This year\, expect expanded scares\, labyrinthine rooms\, and unsettling horrors that will haunt your dreams. \n📍OUR NEW HOME\nMarietta Community House “Crypt” 264 W Market St\, Marietta\, PA \n🎃FAMILY NIGHT & COSTUME PARADE\nJoin us on Saturday for the annual Costume Parade! The march will culminate at the Marietta Community House for an evening of festive\, family-friendly thrills. We are currently conjuring up a full schedule of activities for all ages—stay tuned! \n🤝JOIN THE CREW\nThis production wouldn’t be possible without our dedicated volunteers and partners. A special shout-out to Willis Boyles\, the twisted creative mind behind the haunt’s design. \nWant to be part of the terror? We will soon release details regarding: \n\nActor Openings (Scare us with your best performance!)\nVolunteer Opportunities\nOfficial Dates & Times\nCommunity Activities\n\nTHANK YOU TO THE BOARDS OF HAUNTED MARIETTA:\n\nHaunted House of Marietta: Willis Boyles\nMarietta Community House (MCH): Susan Snider\nMarietta Area Business Association (MABA)\nMarietta Restoration Associates (MRA)
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/haunted-marietta/
LOCATION:Marietta Community House\, 264 W Market St\, Marietta\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Autumn,Children & Family Events,Community Interest,Halloween,Holiday,Marietta,Outdoor Activities,River Towns
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/marietta-event-haunted-marietta.webp
END:VEVENT
