SUMMARY:ApocaLititz 5K
DESCRIPTION:It’s the fitness event of the spooky season!\nHosted by Venture Lititz and Stoll & Wolfe Whiskey\, this fun 5k encourages you to compete in costume. Prizes are awarded to the fastest runners AND the best dressed. The route is beginner friendly\, right here in downtown Lititz! Run or walk\, dress up or don’t\, either way you’re in for a super fun day raising funds for Venture Lititz!
