SUMMARY:Fall Market Day at Refreshing Mountain
DESCRIPTION:Come for this special fall day as we feature local vendors selling handmade local products. Vendors will include everything from yummy treats\, festive decor\, wearables for your furry friends\, to jewelry\, and crochet blankets. Bring the whole family and enjoy our yard games\, special day of deals on activities\, coloring contest\, and enter win prizes including a gift basket and experiences on our popular Christmas light adventures. \n9:00AM – 5:00PM – Vendors (located at Pool Pavilion) and Cafe Open \n4:30PM – Day begins to wind down – Make sure to enter the giveaway contest and turn in Coloring Artwork!
