SUMMARY:Live Music with Songsmith at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup up of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nSongsmith is the creative collaboration of experienced musicians Steve Davis and Lynn Royer. Bringing talent\, experience\, and creativity to every performance\, Songsmith is a breath of fresh air to the Central PA acoustic music scene. Playing an eclectic mix of covers\, arrangements\, and originals\, Songsmith brings fun\, quality entertainment and industry professionalism to your venue or event. \nLynn Royer: Vocals & Hand Percussion\nLynn has provided exceptional vocal abilities to a number of musical projects- both acoustic and electric and she has a beautiful tonal quality- both accurate and emotive. Her song writing skills are first-rate\, with several songwriting awards to her credit. Lynn is also a teacher for children with special needs. \nSteve Davis: Guitar & Vocals\nSteve is a powerful acoustic and electric guitarist employing tasteful use of live loop and other technologies (never prerecorded) he has the ability to play in a wide range of styles. Steve also adds lead and harmony vocals to the mix. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/cherry-crest-live-music-songsmith/
